## 30. Assistive technologies and how to test with them
| Technology | Used by | Quick test |
|---|---|---|
| NVDA (Windows) | Blind users | Press `H` to jump between headings, `K` between links |
| TalkBack (Android) | Blind users on phones | Swipe through the page and listen |
| VoiceOver (iPhone, Mac) | Blind users | Use the Rotor to list headings and links |
| Screen magnifier / browser zoom | Low-vision users | Zoom to 200% to 400% |
| Voice control | Motor-impaired users | Say a button's visible name; it should activate |
| Switch access | Severe motor impairment | Check that all items are reachable in order |

